        "subject": "LU-20253 idl: reserve OBD_CONNECT2_RENAMEAT2 flag",
        "message": "LU-20253 idl: reserve OBD_CONNECT2_RENAMEAT2 flag\n\nReserve OBD_CONNECT2_RENAMEAT2 at 0x800000000000ULL for renameat2()\nflags such as RENAME_WHITEOUT.  Only the flag, obd_connect_names[]\nand the wire checks are added here so the value can land before the\nfeature patch.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5.5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I79b12947703beda06980fe57d457c81bfb4ba21e\n"
      },
